311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 144 0 R
/T (Agricultureis affected by crop health, soil properties, irrigation, climate, cultivation practices, and changing market conditions. Farmers often need to consult different sources to understand these factors, and the information may be difficult to interpret without specialist support. Annadatha AI aims to provide a unified web interface through which users can submit crop photographs and relevant farm details, then receive an AI-assisted summary of visible crop concerns and possible next steps. )
/E (Agricultureis affected by crop health, soil properties, irrigation, climate, cultivation practices, and changing market conditions. Farmers often need to consult different sources to understand these factors, and the information may be difficult to interpret without specialist support. Annadatha AI aims to provide a unified web interface through which users can submit crop photographs and relevant farm details, then receive an AI-assisted summary of visible crop concerns and possible next steps. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
312 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 144 0 R
/T (1.2 Background )
/E (1.2 Background )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 144 0 R
/T (Recent advances in computer vision and large language models make it possible to analyse images alongside contextual information. A crop photograph can provide visual evidence of leaf spots, discoloration, wilting, or other visible symptoms, while details such as crop variety, growth stage, soil characteristics, and recent weather can help frame the interpretation. Such predictions remain uncertain: similar symptoms can have different causes, and image quality or missing context can affect the output. )
/E (Recent advances in computer vision and large language models make it possible to analyse images alongside contextual information. A crop photograph can provide visual evidence of leaf spots, discoloration, wilting, or other visible symptoms, while details such as crop variety, growth stage, soil characteristics, and recent weather can help frame the interpretation. Such predictions remain uncertain: similar symptoms can have different causes, and image quality or missing context can affect the output. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 144 0 R
/T (Annadatha AI is conceived as a decision-support application rather than a substitute for field inspection. The interface is intended to combine image upload, farm-profile inputs, AI analysis, weather context, history, and farmer-oriented recommendations. Its server-side architecture also separates browser interaction from AI provider credentials. )
/E (Annadatha AI is conceived as a decision-support application rather than a substitute for field inspection. The interface is intended to combine image upload, farm-profile inputs, AI analysis, weather context, history, and farmer-oriented recommendations. Its server-side architecture also separates browser interaction from AI provider credentials. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 144 0 R
/T (1.3 Problem Statement )
/E (1.3 Problem Statement )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 144 0 R
/T (Farmers may nothaveimmediate access to a crop specialist or a simple digital workflow for interpreting visible crop symptoms together with cultivation context. Existing information sources can be fragmented, and generic advice may not reflect crop stage, soil condition, irrigation, or local weather. The problem addressed by Annadatha AI is the lack of a single, accessible interface that organizes these inputs and presents an understandable, structured AI- assisted assessment while communicating uncertainty and encouraging expert verification. )
/E (Farmers may nothaveimmediate access to a crop specialist or a simple digital workflow for interpreting visible crop symptoms together with cultivation context. Existing information sources can be fragmented, and generic advice may not reflect crop stage, soil condition, irrigation, or local weather. The problem addressed by Annadatha AI is the lack of a single, accessible interface that organizes these inputs and presents an understandable, structured AI- assisted assessment while communicating uncertainty and encouraging expert verification. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 144 0 R
/T (1.4 Motivation )
/E (1.4 Motivation )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 144 0 R
/T (The projectis motivated by the opportunity to make agricultural information easier to access, especially for users who benefit from visual summaries and multilingual interfaces. A guided form can help users record relevant farm details, while a structured report can make crop-health information easier to review. Provider fallback and clear error handling are intended to improve resilience when an AI service is temporarily unavailable. )
/E (The projectis motivated by the opportunity to make agricultural information easier to access, especially for users who benefit from visual summaries and multilingual interfaces. A guided form can help users record relevant farm details, while a structured report can make crop-health information easier to review. Provider fallback and clear error handling are intended to improve resilience when an AI service is temporarily unavailable. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
