435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 148 0 R
/T (The practical gap addressed by the project is integration. Users may need to combine image- based observations, crop and soil details, weather, and market context across separate services. Annadatha AI aims to make this workflow more coherent through a single interface, structured AI output, and clear distinctions between live information, AI estimates, and demo content. Demonstrating a true research contribution will require formal evaluation of accuracy, usefulness, response time, and usability in realistic field conditions. )
/E (The practical gap addressed by the project is integration. Users may need to combine image- based observations, crop and soil details, weather, and market context across separate services. Annadatha AI aims to make this workflow more coherent through a single interface, structured AI output, and clear distinctions between live information, AI estimates, and demo content. Demonstrating a true research contribution will require formal evaluation of accuracy, usefulness, response time, and usability in realistic field conditions. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [24]
>>
