/T (Theuser submits one or more crop photographs along with farm and crop details. The server constructs a prompt that asks the model to distinguish visible evidence from inference, report uncertainty, and return a structured object. The expected analysis may include crop name and confidence, growth stage, health score and status, possible disease, severity, yield outlook, risk factors, recommendations, and farmer advice. These fields represent intended application output; their reliability must be assessed through testing. )
