/T (Server functions receivevalidated request data and perform external API calls without exposing secret keys to the browser. Input validation should enforce allowed image data URLs, a bounded number of images, known provider names, supported languages, and size limits. Output validation should verify required keys and types, check numeric ranges, and reject malformed JSON. Missing fields must be marked unknown or trigger a controlled error rather than being filled with invented scores. )
/E (Server functions receivevalidated request data and perform external API calls without exposing secret keys to the browser. Input validation should enforce allowed image data URLs, a bounded number of images, known provider names, supported languages, and size limits. Output validation should verify required keys and types, check numeric ranges, and reject malformed JSON. Missing fields must be marked unknown or trigger a controlled error rather than being filled with invented scores. )
