/T (The primary providerisGoogle Gemini. If the request fails for a recoverable availability or rate- limit reason, the application may retry within a bounded policy. If the primary provider is unavailable or the configured model is not found, the request may be routed to OpenRouter using the configured model slug. Provider errors should be logged on the server with sensitive information removed. If both providers fail, the UI should show a generic message and allow the user to choose Demo Analysis. Demo results must be prominently labelled as demonstration data and never be stored or displayed as real diagnosis without a clear label. )
/E (The primary providerisGoogle Gemini. If the request fails for a recoverable availability or rate- limit reason, the application may retry within a bounded policy. If the primary provider is unavailable or the configured model is not found, the request may be routed to OpenRouter using the configured model slug. Provider errors should be logged on the server with sensitive information removed. If both providers fail, the UI should show a generic message and allow the user to choose Demo Analysis. Demo results must be prominently labelled as demonstration data and never be stored or displayed as real diagnosis without a clear label. )
