/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 159 0 R
/T (Annadatha AI proposes a unified web application that helps organize crop images and farm context into a structured AI-assisted assessment. Its core design combines a React and TypeScript interface, server-side request handling, a primary Gemini provider with an OpenRouter fallback, response validation, and user-facing result presentation. The broader goal is to make crop-health information easier to access while clearly communicating uncertainty and the need for expert verification. )
/E (Annadatha AI proposes a unified web application that helps organize crop images and farm context into a structured AI-assisted assessment. Its core design combines a React and TypeScript interface, server-side request handling, a primary Gemini provider with an OpenRouter fallback, response validation, and user-facing result presentation. The broader goal is to make crop-health information easier to access while clearly communicating uncertainty and the need for expert verification. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
