/T (The most important engineering principles are secure handling of API credentials, schema validation, bounded retry behavior, clear separation of demo and live results, and truthful display of weather or market information. These principles improve reliability and reduce the risk that incomplete or fabricated information will be mistaken for real agricultural data. )
/E (The most important engineering principles are secure handling of API credentials, schema validation, bounded retry behavior, clear separation of demo and live results, and truthful display of weather or market information. These principles improve reliability and reduce the risk that incomplete or fabricated information will be mistaken for real agricultural data. )
