/Title (The application is developed using a modern web stack based on React, TypeScript, and TanStack Start. Server-side functions are used to validate requests and keep provider credentials out of browser code. The AI integration is designed to try Google Gemini first and use OpenRouter as a fallback when the primary provider is unavailable. Responses must be validated before being shown to users, and failures should produce a friendly message rather than raw provider errors. Additional planned or integrated areas include multilingual UI, location-aware weather, crop and analysis history, market information, and learning-oriented AR/MR experiences.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1620 0 R
/Prev 1636 0 R
/Next 1637 0 R
>>
