/Title (Annadatha AI proposes a unified web application that helps organize crop images and farm context into a structured AI-assisted assessment. Its core design combines a React and TypeScript interface, server-side request handling, a primary Gemini provider with an OpenRouter fallback, response validation, and user-facing result presentation. The broader goal is to make crop-health information easier to access while clearly communicating uncertainty and the need for expert verification.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1692 0 R
/Next 1721 0 R
>>
endobj
1721 0 obj
<<
/Title (The most important engineering principles are secure handling of API credentials, schema validation, bounded retry behavior, clear separation of demo and live results, and truthful display of weather or market information. These principles improve reliability and reduce the risk that incomplete or fabricated information will be mistaken for real agricultural data.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1692 0 R
/Prev 1720 0 R
>>
endobj
