/Title (The project design includes a modern React and TypeScript application, server-side AI integration, a primary/fallback provider strategy, and a structured crop-analysis workflow. During development, provider model availability and dependency compatibility can cause failures even when the UI code is valid. These issues must be addressed through accurate environment configuration, compatible dependency versions, lockfile verification, and testing of the deployed build.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1719 0 R
/Next 1750 0 R
>>
