<<
/Title (Recent advances in computer vision and large language models make it possible to analyse images alongside contextual information. A crop photograph can provide visual evidence of leaf spots, discoloration, wilting, or other visible symptoms, while details such as crop variety, growth stage, soil characteristics, and recent weather can help frame the interpretation. Such predictions remain uncertain: similar symptoms can have different causes, and image quality or missing context can affect the output.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1871 0 R
/Next 1890 0 R
>>
endobj
1890 0 obj
<<
/Title (Annadatha AI is conceived as a decision-support application rather than a substitute for field inspection. The interface is intended to combine image upload, farm-profile inputs, AI analysis, weather context, history, and farmer-oriented recommendations. Its server-side architecture also separates browser interaction from AI provider credentials.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1871 0 R
/Prev 1889 0 R
>>
