<<
/Title (Farmers may nothaveimmediate access to a crop specialist or a simple digital workflow for interpreting visible crop symptoms together with cultivation context. Existing information sources can be fragmented, and generic advice may not reflect crop stage, soil condition, irrigation, or local weather. The problem addressed by Annadatha AI is the lack of a single, accessible interface that organizes these inputs and presents an understandable, structured AI- assisted assessment while communicating uncertainty and encouraging expert verification.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1891 0 R
>>
endobj
