/Title (AnnadathaAI proposes acommon interface for crop photographs, cultivation details, AI- assisted analysis, and contextual agricultural information. The application sends validated input to a server-side function, which builds a prompt and calls the selected AI provider. Gemini is attempted first; OpenRouter is used as a fallback when appropriate. The result is normalized and validated against an expected schema before being displayed. If providers fail, the interface should show a friendly unavailable message and offer a clearly labelled demo analysis only when the user explicitly chooses it.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1941 0 R
